## Appendix: Service Dependency Impact

The Auth Service outage demonstrated the critical nature of this service. The following dependency chain was affected:

1. Auth Service failed (root cause)
2. API Gateway could not validate tokens → 503 to all requests
3. Order Service could not authenticate internal calls → order processing stopped
4. Payment Service could not validate merchant tokens → payments failed
5. Inventory Service could not authenticate → stock checks failed
6. Notification Service degraded → messages queued but not sent

This incident highlighted the need for Auth Service high availability improvements.
